{"anime_data":{"id":215425,"name":"映画 中二病でも恋がしたい！ -Take On Me-","name_cn":"电影 中二病也要谈恋爱！ -Take On Me-","short_summary":"“18岁，高中的最后一年。但六花却……依然是中二病！”\r\n在大学考试逼近的高三的春假，勇太与六花依然在一起生活，但看起来至今依然尚未缔结上级契约。就在某天，十花突然说要带六花去意大利生活：因为工作已经稳定下来，所以想要全家一起搬过去住。虽然","score":7.5,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/d4/3b/215425_i1V31.jpg","eps":1,"date":"2018-01-06","summary":"“18岁，高中的最后一年。但六花却……依然是中二病！”\r\n在大学考试逼近的高三的春假，勇太与六花依然在一起生活，但看起来至今依然尚未缔结上级契约。就在某天，十花突然说要带六花去意大利生活：因为工作已经稳定下来，所以想要全家一起搬过去住。虽然勇太对此感到焦急，但也很同意十花“不能放着很有可能考不进大学的六花不管”的看法。再这样下去，两人的关系很有可能出现裂痕。对此感到担心的丹生谷等人，竟对勇太提出“私奔”的提案。\r\n就这样，以日本全国为舞台，两人的逃亡剧就此展开。","total_episodes":4,"characters":[{"id":17362,"name":"小鳥遊六花","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a7/6c/17362_crt_yPAVp.jpg?r=1642151054","actor_ids":[6724],"name_cn":"小鸟游六花","summary":"メインヒロイン。現役中二病患者で、自称「邪王真眼の使い手」。理数系は壊滅的なほどできないが、中二病の影響で国語や社会および英語はそこそこできる。裁縫は得意だが料理はできない。作者あとがきによると最終的にお馬鹿でまったく面影もなくなってしまったが涼宮ハルヒシリーズの長門有希がモデルの模様。アニメ公式HPのトップでもっている銃はモーゼルC96(モーゼルミリタリー)である。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":6,"birth_day":12,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"小鸟游六花","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"6月12日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"A型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"150cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"47kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"BWH","value":"78/53/80","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17363,"name":"富樫勇太","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/07/83/17363_crt_efqIF.jpg?r=1361630049","actor_ids":[3818],"name_cn":"富樫勇太","summary":"主人公。元中二病患者で高校生活を充実した物にするため中学卒業とともに猛勉強して中二病も卒業した。しかし、屋上で隠れて中二病的なセリフを叫んだり、学校に「闇」の文字が入ったTシャツを着てきたりするなどまだ完治はしていない。そこを六花に目撃され、契約する羽目になった。周囲に元中二病だったことを隠しているが、Tシャツなどの件はバレバレ。猛勉強したため成績は全般的に優秀。英語が比較的苦手の模様。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":7,"birth_day":7,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"富樫勇太","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"7月7日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"A型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"170cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"60kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://www.anime-chu-2.com/character/yuta/","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17364,"name":"丹生谷森夏","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/34/20/17364_crt_klp1q.jpg?r=1610523138","actor_ids":[7297],"name_cn":"丹生谷森夏","summary":"高等部1年4組→2年4組。勇太のクラスメイトで委員長。容姿端麗、クラスでも一、二を争う美少女で男子の人気を集めるマドンナであり「学級王」とも呼ばれる。ピンクのクリップで前髪を整えている。学業成績は優秀だが数学だけは苦手。ダンス部に所属している。「もりさま」と呼ばれると怒る。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":30,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"丹生谷森夏","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月30日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"B型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"165cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"57kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"BWH","value":"86/57/83","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17365,"name":"一色誠","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/36/b0/17365_crt_k7G6k.jpg","actor_ids":[3884],"name_cn":"一色诚","summary":"勇太のクラスメイト。実際成績も良く風紀委員。まじめで誠実だが、一方で女子のプロフィールなどの情報を集めてメモしていたりなど真面目に女子が大好きな変態。一部、ネタとして涼宮ハルヒシリーズの谷口を彷彿とさせる場面がある。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"一色诚","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17366,"name":"富樫樟葉","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/be/bc/17366_crt_x66b6.jpg","actor_ids":[5046],"name_cn":"富樫樟叶","summary":"勇太の上の妹。中学1年生。不在の父母の代わりに家事をこなしている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"富樫樟叶","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17367,"name":"富樫夢葉","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/7e/e0/17367_crt_PweDl.jpg","actor_ids":[7904],"name_cn":"富樫梦叶","summary":"勇太の下の妹。5歳。将来有望（中二病患者として）。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"富樫梦叶","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17368,"name":"五月七日くみん","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/11/99/17368_crt_UU47b.jpg","actor_ids":[5827],"name_cn":"五月七日枯茗","summary":"勇太や六花の一つ上の先輩。どこでも寝れる能力に長けている。\r\n\r\n关于译名：クミン（英語: cumin、学名：Cuminum cyminum），中文为“孜然芹”，其种籽（クミン・シード、cumin seed）作为香料时简称“孜然”，又名小茴香、阿拉伯茴香、安息茴香、枯茗，与中文的“茴香”（フェンネル、Foeniculum vulgare）并非一种植物，所以译作“茴香”无论从音还是意都是错误的；“小茴香”同时可代指孜然、茴香和莳萝，不能算错，也不精确；“久民”音译准确但抛弃了意思；“枯茗”作为英语的音译，同时保留了音和意，故选择写在“简体中文名”一栏。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":10,"birth_day":14,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"五月七日枯茗","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"10月14日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17369,"name":"凸守早苗","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/62/04/17369_crt_8YjKp.jpg","actor_ids":[7307],"name_cn":"凸守早苗","summary":"現役中二病患者で、六花の唯一無二な「サーヴァント」という設定。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":8,"birth_day":9,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"凸守早苗","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"8月9日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17370,"name":"勇太の母","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/bd/87/17370_crt_GXGlA.jpg","actor_ids":[4124],"name_cn":"勇太的母亲","summary":"勇太の母親","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"勇太的母亲","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17371,"name":"九十九七瀬","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/8f/6d/17371_crt_WzzHM.jpg","actor_ids":[3945],"name_cn":"九十九七濑","summary":"勇太のクラスの担任。語尾に「ぅ」と付く独特の口調が特徴。愛称は「ナナちゃん」。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"九十九七濑","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":17460,"name":"小鳥遊十花","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/22/ae/17460_crt_WY11w.jpg","actor_ids":[4749],"name_cn":"小鸟游十花","summary":"动画原创角色。六花的姐姐。职业是厨师，高中时是体操选手，经常为妹妹烹饪美味的料理。表面上看不出感情的类型，唯独于梦叶面前显得较从容。\r\n被妄想时的设定为不可视境界线管理局的女教皇，有许多令人恐惧的超能力，包括瞬间移动。\r\n随身带着汤杓，用来和中二状态的六花打架，积极想矫正六花的中二病。\r\n被六花称为“圣调理人”。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":2,"birth_day":15,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"小鸟游十花","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"2月15日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"wikipedia","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":18059,"name":"六花の母","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/70/d4/18059_crt_DRdR9.jpg","actor_ids":[3916],"name_cn":"六花的母亲","summary":"名前は不明。アニメでは夫の死後、六花と十花を夫の実家に置いて出て行ったが、その後も２人の娘にした事を悔いてる。イタリア本店から十花の料理修行の誘いの話が来た事で、十花から妹を託されるが、六花に合わせる顔も無く手作り弁当を勇太から六花に渡してほしいと頼んだ。控えめで大人しい女性。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"六花的母亲","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":18231,"name":"七宮智音","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/84/41/18231_crt_1K6kf.jpg?r=1620401120","actor_ids":[8493],"name_cn":"七宫智音","summary":"勇太の中学時代の同級生で中二病の女子。「ソフィアリング・SP・サターン7世」を名乗り中二病である事を自覚し中二病に徹する。勇太の憧れの対象であり、また中二病を患ったきっかけとなった人物である。唯一の友達であり理解者であったが突然転校して勇太の前から姿を消した。転校先は丹生谷の出身中学校であり、丹生谷に中二病を患らわせた張本人でもある。\r\n高等部に闖入して過去の出来事を思い出させて丹生谷を身悶えさせたり、勇太と六花の関係に波乱を巻き起こす。\r\nアニメには登場しない。\r\n\r\n中二病患者。勇太初中时的青梅竹马，后来亦成为高中的同学。\r\n被妄想时的设定为“苏菲娅宁·SP·萨图尔努斯7世”，攻击防御都达至最高水平。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":7,"birth_day":6,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"七宫智音","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"生日","value":"7月6日","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"血型","value":"B型","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"身高","value":"156cm","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"体重","value":"50kg","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":18270,"name":"デラ・モチマッヅィ","relation":"客串","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ad/5e/18270_crt_GtNfM.jpg","actor_ids":[],"name_cn":"德拉·摩奇玛兹","summary":"自称由南方国家到来。懂得说人话的鸟。 \r\n似乎怀着什么目的去亲近玉子。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"德拉·摩奇玛兹","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":72919,"name":"きめら","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a1/8f/72919_crt_Km33l.jpg","actor_ids":[4960],"name_cn":"奇美拉","summary":"动画原创角色。\r\n小鸟游六花拾养的猫。为了让它有使魔的感觉而取名奇美拉。\r\n似乎拥有找出不可视境界线的能力，毛色为白灰相间，背上还有六花手制的翅膀和蛇尾。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"奇美拉","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"雌","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"baike.baidu.com/item/奇美拉/13001196","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"}],"relations":[{"id":29561,"name":"中二病でも恋がしたい!","name_cn":"中二病也要谈恋爱!","relation":"书籍","type":1,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/9f/d4/29561_0sV00.jpg","__dataclass__":"Relation"},{"id":72942,"name":"中二病でも恋がしたい！戀","name_cn":"中二病也要谈恋爱！恋","relation":"前传","type":2,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/c8/e4/72942_VniXv.jpg","__dataclass__":"Relation"},{"id":233851,"name":"『映画 中二病でも恋がしたい! -Take On Me-』オリジナルサウンドトラック","name_cn":"","relation":"原声集","type":3,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/a2/f6/233851_0a4MM.jpg","__dataclass__":"Relation"},{"id":235098,"name":"JOURNEY","name_cn":"","relation":"片头曲","type":3,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/8b/73/235098_v2ymH.jpg","__dataclass__":"Relation"},{"id":259642,